{"id":"n71211-2-12","stage":1,"title":"재료 · 材料","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71211-2-12-1","ko":"이번에 새로 창업을 해 볼까 해.","zh":"这次我想试着创业。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"창업을","meaning":"创业","explanation":"창업：创业；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"창업","audio":"/audio/c351b889d3aa8bcf7a36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82791","senseId":"2","lemma":"창업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"창업을","audio":"/audio/6015ddfbe017dd7fc2e8.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"볼까","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼까","audio":"/audio/ac480717af809a867fd7.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","explanation":"하다：考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"c351b889d3aa8bcf","term":"창업","zh":"创业","audio":"/audio/c351b889d3aa8bcf7a36.mp3","entryId":"82791","definition":"首次开始事业等。","pronunciation":["창ː업"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0ee33644893cf78fc06a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71211-2-12-2","ko":"사업 재료는 뭔데? 어떤 사업 하려고?","zh":"有什么创业点子？打算做什么生意？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사업","meaning":"事业，生意","explanation":"사업：事业，生意","readings":[{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62048","senseId":"1","lemma":"사업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사업","audio":"/audio/7b3733aab2fd0dcf59d4.mp3"}},{"text":"재료는","meaning":"材料","explanation":"재료：材料；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"재료","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71211","senseId":"2","lemma":"재료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재료는","audio":"/audio/6c89b9ac206c47034469.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔데?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseI